              "long_description": "Number of Medicare-registered hospitals per geography that meet CMS's criteria for the 'Birthing Friendly' designation, which recognizes hospitals participating in a national or state perinatal quality improvement collaborative and implementing evidence-based best practices to improve maternal health outcomes and reduce preventable harm during obstetric care. This is a facility-count snapshot from CMS's current list of designated hospitals with geocoded addresses, not a longitudinal survey; each ingest run reflects the list as most recently published by CMS, so period-to-period changes reflect hospitals gaining or losing the designation (or address corrections), not a moving time series in the usual sense.",
